OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after men attacked with
OL,4,Abaseball bat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have made three arrests after
OL,7,Fthree men were attacked with baseball
OL,8,Fbats in Retford.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said two men got
OL,11,Fout of a black BMW one series on Friday
OL,12,Fat about 14:45 BST and assaulted three
OL,13,Fmen in Northfield Way. The car then
OL,14,Fstruck one of the men, the force added.
OL,16,FA 19-year-old was taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith a head injury and the BMW was
OL,18,Flater found at 15:50 in Ranskill Road,
OL,19,FMattersey, where it had been burnt out.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
